CREATE ONE NEW FILE: scripts/scs001/validate-production-preflight.ts. Do NOT modify any existing file.

This script checks all prerequisites for live TikTok posting and outputs a human-readable checklist with fix hints.

EXACT REQUIREMENTS:

1. IMPORTS:
   import { existsSync, readFileSync } from 'fs';
   import { join } from 'path';
   No other imports.

2. INTERFACE:
   interface PreflightCheck { id: string; name: string; pass: boolean; details: string; required: boolean; fix_hint: string; }

3. DEFINE 7 CHECKS:
   (a) tiktok-token: pass = !!(process.env.TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN), required=true, fix_hint='Set TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN in .env — obtain from TikTok Developer Portal > Manage Apps > Access Token'
   (b) supabase-url: pass = !!(process.env.SUPABASE_URL), required=true, fix_hint='Set SUPABASE_URL in .env — from Supabase Dashboard > Settings > API > Project URL'
   (c) supabase-key: pass = !!(process.env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY), required=true, fix_hint='Set SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY in .env — from Supabase Dashboard > Settings > API > service_role key (NOT anon key)'
   (d) editing-mode: pass = process.env.SCS_EDITING_MODE === 'production', required=false, fix_hint='Set SCS_EDITING_MODE=production in .env for drawtext + subtitle burn-in video quality'
   (e) scs-mode: pass = process.env.SCS_MODE === 'live', required=true, fix_hint='Set SCS_MODE=live in .env or start with: pm2 start ecosystem.config.js --only scs001-live'
   (f) ecosystem-live: required=true. Read ecosystem.config.js (join(process.cwd(), 'ecosystem.config.js')). If file does not exist, pass=false, details='ecosystem.config.js not found'. If file exists, check contents.includes('scs001-live'), set pass accordingly. fix_hint='Run Sprint 097 tasks to add scs001-live process to ecosystem.config.js'
   (g) hosting-service: pass = !!(process.env.SUPABASE_URL && process.env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY), required=true, fix_hint='Set both SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY for Supabase Storage video hosting (needed for TikTok PULL_FROM_URL)'

   For secret values (tokens, keys), show only first 8 chars: token.substring(0, 8) + '...'
   For details field of each check: if pass, show what is set (truncated); if fail, show 'NOT SET' or 'NOT FOUND'

4. PRINT RESULTS:
   console.log('\n=== SCS-001 PRODUCTION PREFLIGHT ===\n');
   checks.forEach(c => {
     console.log((c.pass ? '\u2713' : '\u2717') + ' [' + (c.required ? 'REQUIRED' : 'OPTIONAL') + '] ' + c.name + ': ' + c.details);
     if (!c.pass) console.log('  FIX: ' + c.fix_hint);
   });

5. SUMMARY AND EXIT:
   const requiredFails = checks.filter(c => c.required && !c.pass);
   const optionalFails = checks.filter(c => !c.required && !c.pass);
   console.log('');
   if (requiredFails.length > 0) {
     console.log('PREFLIGHT BLOCKED — ' + requiredFails.length + ' required check(s) failed.');
     console.log('Fix the REQUIRED items above, then re-run: npx ts-node scripts/scs001/validate-production-preflight.ts');
     process.exit(1);
   } else {
     console.log('PREFLIGHT PASS — all required checks met.');
     if (optionalFails.length > 0) console.log('(' + optionalFails.length + ' optional enhancement(s) available — see OPTIONAL items above)');
     console.log('Ready: pm2 start ecosystem.config.js --only scs001-live');
     process.exit(0);
   }

6. WRAP in: async function main(): Promise<void> {} called with main().catch(err => { console.error(err); process.exit(1); });

FAIL CONDITIONS:
(1) Any import other than 'fs' and 'path'
(2) Missing TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN check
(3) Missing Supabase URL and key checks
(4) No fix hints printed for failures
(5) Any existing file modified
(6) Script does not exit with code 1 when required checks fail
(7) Secrets/tokens printed in full (must truncate)
